WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
«I've run out of contacts.»

2
00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:06.350
How many people do you have saved in your phone?

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.170
Three hundred? A thousand?

4
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.740
You're not short of contacts.

5
00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:13.360
You're short of rhythm. RelAI makes you do the count.

6
00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:19.350
And the Consultant teaches you to fill your contact list, offline and online, without spam and without bought lists.

7
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.000
The list of names. Everyday life.

8
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.190
Introductions. Your profile,

9
00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.510
groups. From a comment to a phone number.

10
00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.940
It works for people you only talk to on Messenger or Instagram too.

11
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.770
Contacts don't run out.

12
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.370
They're asleep.
